   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "stall 输出长什么样（示意，数字为虚构）\nrcu: INFO: rcu_preempt detected stalls on CPUs/tasks:\nrcu:     3-....: (20999 ticks this GP) idle=…/1/0x4000000000000000\n         softirq=1234/1234 fqs=5249\nrcu:     (detected by 0, t=21002 jiffies, g=12345, q=678 ncpus=8)\n\n读法：\n· 3-....  欠 QS 的是 CPU3\n· ticks this GP 很大：它在内核里跑了很久\n· softirq=a/b 两个数相同：softirq 没机会跑\n· fqs=0 的话先怀疑 GP kthread 没跑起来",
   "originalText": "stall 输出长什么样（示意，数字为虚构）\nrcu: INFO: rcu_preempt detected stalls on CPUs/tasks:\nrcu:     3-....: (20999 ticks this GP) idle=…/1/0x4000000000000000\n         softirq=1234/1234 fqs=5249\nrcu:     (detected by 0, t=21002 jiffies, g=12345, q=678 ncpus=8)\n\n读法：\n· 3-....  欠 QS 的是 CPU3\n· ticks this GP 很大：它在内核里跑了很久\n· softirq=a/b 两个数相同：softirq 没机会跑\n· fqs=0 的话先怀疑 GP kthread 没跑起来",
